	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「ソードアート・オンライン」からメインヒロインの「アスナ」が登場！",
			"• 髪の毛の一部を新素材で成形。パーツ分割により可動する髪の毛はポージングを阻害しない設計になっている。",
			"• 太もも部分はパーツの内側に赤みの強いパーツをはめる二層構造で、自然な肌の質感を追求。",
			"• 伸ばす、ひねる、曲げるなど、実際の人体のような関節ギミックにより自然な動きを再現可能。",
			"• 「通常顔」に加え「叫び顔」「怒り顔」の３種類が付属。ポージングに合わせた表情を楽しめる。",
			"• 抜刀・納刀を一部パーツの差し替えで表現。ハンドパーツは右手３種、左手２種の計５種が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The main heroine \"Asuna\" from \"Sword Art Online\" appears!",
			"• Part of the hair is molded from a new material. The hair is movable due to its separate parts and is designed to not interfere with posing.",
			"• The thigh area has a two-layer structure with a reddish part on the inside to create a natural skin texture.",
			"• Natural movements such as stretching, twisting, and bending can be reproduced using joint gimmicks similar to those of the real human body.",
			"• In addition to the \"normal face\", three types are included: \"screaming face\" and \"angry face\". You can enjoy the expressions that match the poses.",
			"• Representing the drawing and sheathing of the sword by replacing some parts. A total of 5 types of hand parts are included, 3 types for the right hand and 2 types for the left hand."
		]
	},
